  "solution": "**Given**\n\n82 × 63 and 46 × 93 \n\n**Concept**\n\n(am)ⁿ = amⁿ\n\n**Calculation**\n\nL.C.M of 82 × 63 and 46 × 93 \n\n82 × 63 = ((2)³)² × (2 × 3)³\n\n⇒ 2⁶ × 2³ × 3³\n\n⇒ 2⁹ × 3³\n\n46 × 93 = ((2)²)⁶ × ((3)²)³\n\n⇒ 2¹² × 3⁶\n\nL.C.M of 82 × 63 and 46 × 93 = 2¹² × 3⁶\n\n**∴ L.C.M of 82 × 63 and 46 × 93 is 2¹² × 3⁶**",
